@startuml protocol-overview
!include astah-style.iuml
title Kommunikationsprotokol

participant "Mobil-app" as App
participant "Ingestion-server" as Ing
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Processing-server" as Proc

App -> Ing : 1: HTTP GET /?event={eventId}
Ing --> App : 2: HTTP 200 index.html, app.js, styles.css

App -> Ing : 3: HTTP GET /events/{eventId}
Ing --> App : 4: HTTP 200 JSON EventInfo(eventId, name, startTime, endTime, sendIntervalSeconds)
note right of Ing : 3–4 er planlagt (ID-21, ID-29)

App -> Ing : 5: HTTP POST /positions JSON PositionRequest(sessionId, eventId,\nlatitude, longitude, accuracy, timestamp)
Ing ->> MQ : 5.1: AMQP basic.publish("", "positions") JSON PositionReceived(sessionId,\neventId, zoneIds, latitude, longitude, accuracy, timestamp)
Ing --> App : 6: HTTP 202 Accepted
MQ ->> Proc : 5.2: AMQP basic.deliver(deliveryTag) JSON PositionReceived(...)
Proc ->> MQ : 5.3: AMQP basic.ack(deliveryTag)

App -> Ing : 7: HTTP <metode> <sti> JSON <request>
Ing --> App : 8: HTTP 4xx JSON ProblemDetail(status, detail)
note right of Ing : Gælder alle HTTP-kald

Ing -> Proc : 9: HTTP GET /events/active
Proc --> Ing : 10: HTTP 200 JSON List<Event(eventId, name, startTime, endTime,\nsendIntervalSeconds, area, zones)>
Proc ->> MQ : 11: AMQP basic.publish("event-changes", "event.<type>") JSON Event / EventDeleted(eventId)
MQ ->> Ing : 11.1: AMQP basic.deliver(deliveryTag) JSON Event / EventDeleted(eventId)
note over Ing, Proc : 9–11.1 er planlagt (ID-35)

@enduml
